      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Hello! This is so nice to chat with you. I've always wanted to get to know people better.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:00:21.824048+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "It's great to hear that, I agree with you. What do you like to do for a hobby?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:01:17.994308+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Did you know that meditation can help with managing stress? I've been reading about it lately.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:01:47.621609+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Wow, that is really cool! I was not aware that meditation could help with stress management. Thank you for sharing this information.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:02:22.352839+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, I didn't know you were interested in meditation! How about I join you and try it? It sounds like a fun way to manage stress.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:04:52.817701+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Wow, I didn't know you were into meditation! What are your reasons for trying it?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:06:07.083315+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What are your reasons for trying meditation?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:08:27.363591+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Absolutely! I'm always open to trying new experiences and seeing what works best for me. Meditation is definitely on the list of activities that I'd like to try.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:11:24.523050+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you for sharing this information, it's really helpful. I didn't know meditation could help with managing stress, I just assumed that it was more of a spiritual practice.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:13:00.456533+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, that's very interesting! What is the concept of meditation?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:14:38.232111+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What is the concept of meditation?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:16:13.432671+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Meditation is a practice that involves focusing the mind on the present moment to reduce stress, anxiety and depression. It's often done through breathing exercises or guided imagery.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-21T11:17:52.026736+00:00"
    }
